Error [jet.ValueTypeMismatch]: Field `key` of `Vault` holds secret-bearing `Secret`, which can't be reflected
  --> Tests/UI/reflect_of_field_not_capturable.jet:19:19
    |
 19 |     _: reflect.of(vault)
    |                   ^^^^^
 Why: `reflect.of` captures every stored field of the value or refuses the value, and this field would expose a cryptographic secret
 Fix: Reflect the value's public fields instead
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0112
